OL,3,GNEWSAOrganised crime gang shooting
OL,4,Atargeted a young child, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo members of a major organised crime
OL,7,Fgang who fired shots into the wrong
OL,8,Fhouse were targeting a young child, a
OL,9,Fcourt has heard.
OL,11,FA jury at Cardiff Crown Court heard the
OL,12,Fshooting in Pyle, Bridgend, on 22
OL,13,FSeptember 2025 was carried out in
OL,14,Fretaliation against Daniel O'
OL,15,FCallaghan, who was allegedly dealing
OL,16,FMDMA on Guernsey.
OL,18,FKian Darkes, 21, and Kyle Long, 40,
OL,19,Fboth from Bridgend, believed he was
OL,20,Fresponsible for the disappearance of
OL,21,Fthousands of pounds worth of Class A
OL,22,Fdrugs hidden on the Channel Island.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
