OL,3,GNEWSAOrganised crime gang shooting
OL,4,Atargeted a young child, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice discovered a photograph of a
OL,7,Fchild on a mobile phone belonging to
OL,8,Fone of the men standing trial, along
OL,9,Fwith text messages between them both
OL,10,Fdiscussing targeting the youngster.
